# F429 UAC microphone detection arm: OTG_HS full-speed host + CherryUSB's
# DWC2 port + the first-party UAC1 host class.  One case brings the controller
# up, waits for the class instance and prints the AudioControl/AudioStreaming
# descriptor census.  It does not open the streaming interface, so this image
# needs no SDRAM and no capture ring.
#
# The census answers whether the camera's audio function is a UAC1 microphone
# at all: bcdADC, interface pair, input terminal, channels/bits, the sample
# rate table and the isochronous IN endpoint's size and interval.
CONFIG_ARCH_ARM_V7M=y
CONFIG_BACKEND_FREERTOS=y
CONFIG_OPT_O2=y
CONFIG_PROFILE_BASE=y
CONFIG_BOARD_STM32F429_CHALLENGER=y
CONFIG_FREERTOS_HEAP_SIZE=65536
CONFIG_BOARD_AUTO_RESET=n
CONFIG_RUNNER_STACK_KB=24
CONFIG_UAC_TARGET_RATE=16000
CONFIG_CASES="uac_detect"